WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.000
[Leaves rustle softly]

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
[Quiet nibbling]

00:12.500 --> 00:14.500
[A seed drops and rolls]

00:15.300 --> 00:18.000
[Paws scratch on earth]

00:25.500 --> 00:28.500
[Small footsteps]

00:36.600 --> 00:38.200
[A soft rustle beneath a paw]

00:39.500 --> 00:41.000
[A light landing on stone]

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
[Nibbling resumes]
[Cloth folds in the distance]
